      "description": "SignalFlow captures meaningful work as Signals, evaluates whether it is worth communicating, resolves narrative direction with Voice and evidence, and returns exact review decisions to the user. Manual owner workflows and a durable GitHub-connected source and planning spine are implemented today; media production, generalized destination-by-form planning, durable publication, and confirmed-public memory continue behind the same canonical records.",
